      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.81 (up from ₹3.82 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.68b (down 23% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹35.5m (up ₹321.8m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.3% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 61% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 14% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
