      "title": "Kanoria Chemicals & Industries Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 500 million in funding from RV Investment & Dealers Limited",
      "body": "Kanoria Chemicals & Industries Limited announced a private placement to issue 500,000 Non-Convertible, Non-Cumulative, Non-Participating, Redeemable Preference Shares at a price of INR 1,000 each for aggregate gross proceeds of INR 500,000,000 on February 12, 2026. The preference shares will have a dividend rate of 7% from the date of allotment on Non cumulative basis. The transaction has been approved by the board of directors and is subject to the approval of the shareholders and other statutory/regulatory authorities. The transaction will include participation from R.V. Investment and Dealers Limited.",
